# UX Mandatory (Conditional)

- Technical review is always mandatory.
- UX review is mandatory when scope changes user-facing flows, pages, components, or copy.
- When no user-facing change exists, report UX as explicitly not applicable.

Minimum UX checks when applicable:
- clarity of labels/messages
- useful error feedback
- loading/empty/success states
- accessibility basics
